 "summary": "Bell Labs string-processing language family (SNOBOL 1962 to SNOBOL4 1967) whose statements are subject/pattern/replacement lines with success/failure gotos; patterns are first-class values with backtracking that exceed regular expressions, and SPITBOL is its fast compiled implementation.",
